    "directions": [
      "Place your chicken in a mixing bowl then season with salt, pepper, pimento, all purpose, paprika, browning, mix together and marinate overnight.",
      "Add vegetable oil to your frying pan on a medium heat, then add sugar and caramelise for a few minutes.",
      "Add chicken pieces and start to brown on each side.",
      "add onions, garlic, thyme, scotch bonnet, add water then stir well.",
      "cook down for 30 minutes on a medium heat, stirring occasionally then simmer until ready.",
